# "During your turn, this creature has hexproof" (CR 702.11b, 611.3a): on Bot1's turn (turn 3) Bot2's Lightning Bolt cannot target Pompous Gadabout, while Bot1 can target it
# with its own Giant Growth (hexproof stops only opponents, CR 702.11b). On Bot2's turn (turn 4) it has no hexproof and Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Pompous Gadabout
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Giant Growth
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x18

